Internetsiz o‘zbekcha nutqni tanish modeli (telefon ilovasi yuklab oladi,
repozitoriyga kiritilmagan):

  STT Uz FastConformer Hybrid Transducer-CTC Large P&C
  by NVIDIA Corporation, licensed under CC BY 4.0
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  Original: https://huggingface.co/nvidia/stt_uz_fastconformer_hybrid_large_pc

Ilova sherpa-onnx uchun tayyorlangan nusxani yuklab oladi:
  https://huggingface.co/algorithco/stt_uz_fastconformer_hybrid_large_pc
  (model.int8.onnx, tokens.txt)

O‘zgarishlar (o‘sha nusxa muallifi ko‘rsatganidek): modelning CTC qismi ONNX’ga
eksport qilingan (OpenVoiceOS), sherpa-onnx o‘qiydigan metama’lumotlar
qo‘shilgan va MatMul og‘irliklari 8 bitga kvantlangan. Model qayta
o‘qitilmagan. z3wax TV modelni o‘zgartirmaydi.

Ishga tushirish kutubxonasi: sherpa-onnx (k2-fsa), Apache-2.0.
